	Define BackOffice										For |CI$00000002
	Define CommunicationServer								For |CI$00000003
	Define TerminalServer									For |CI$00000004
	Define SmallBusinessRestricted							For |CI$00000005
	Define EmbeddedNT										For |CI$00000006
	Define DataCenter										For |CI$00000007
	Define SingleUserTS										For |CI$00000008
	Define Personal											For |CI$00000009
	Define Blade											For |CI$0000000A
